NimbyShared - original work by Jeff Fabish for NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp.
The shared client addon of the @NIMBY pack: the window shell (a UIScriptedMenu base class, a
pause-menu button registry over the vanilla DayZ 1.30 InGameMenu class, Bohemia Interactive)
and the chunked RPC codec, both extracted from NimbyGreet (plan
docs/plans/2026-10-31-nimby-shared-plan.md). No third-party mod code; no media.

